{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>\u201cFlesh is a dark fantasy game where you play as a mage who begins on a path to learn the secrets of necromancy. Journey through the broken world of Alma as you search for the powers locked within the human body.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>What sort of mysteries will you uncover?\u201d</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Kleinman XOXO</u> / <i>Internet Personality</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore Alma</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Walk through broken villages, dark ruins, and ancient places.  <br>Monsters wait in many corners.  <br>You can go different paths in your own order. Freedom is yours.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Learn Necromancy and Defy Death</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use strange magic to take the remains of monsters and bring them back as undead.  <br>They will fight for you.  <br>Battles are turn-based. Think carefully. Use your powers wisely.  <br>Discover spells and strange items that make you stronger.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Made for 2018\u2019s <i>A Game By Its Cover</i> Game Jam. Inspired by the \u201cFlesh\u201d cover from Japan's <i>My Famicase Exhibition</i>.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3078230?t=1749129634","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078230/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1749129634","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078230/b6275e07a5fff93f6b6a978c1c5ced3fd73ca9ea/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749129634","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078230/b6275e07a5fff93f6b6a978c1c5ced3fd73ca9ea/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749129634","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,5],"notes":"This Game may contain content not appropriate for all ages, or may not be appropriate for viewing at work, including Cartoon-like Violence and Gore, Partial Nudity and General Mature Content."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>\u201cFlesh is a dark fantasy game where you play as a mage who begins on a path to learn the secrets of necromancy. Journey through the broken world of Alma as you search for the powers locked within the human body.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>What sort of mysteries will you uncover?\u201d</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Kleinman XOXO</u> / <i>Internet Personality</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore Alma</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Walk through broken villages, dark ruins, and ancient places.  <br>Monsters wait in many corners.  <br>You can go different paths in your own order. Freedom is yours.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Learn Necromancy and Defy Death</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use strange magic to take the remains of monsters and bring them back as undead.  <br>They will fight for you.  <br>Battles are turn-based. Think carefully. Use your powers wisely.  <br>Discover spells and strange items that make you stronger.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Made for 2018\u2019s <i>A Game By Its Cover</i> Game Jam. Inspired by the \u201cFlesh\u201d cover from Japan's <i>My Famicase Exhibition</i>.</p>","developers":["KA*IN WORKS"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078230/header.jpg?t=1749129634","is_free":true,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2018 KA\u00b7IN WORKS. All rights reserved.<br />\r\nThe original title, logo, cover design, and conceptual overview for \u201cFlesh\u201d are \u00a9 2018 Kleinman XOXO and used with permission.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3078230/783541/3bcc26162de977